  <title>
    <media type="image" width="40px" height="40px" its:translate="no" src="figures/orca-logo.svg" /> Bypass mode
  </title>
  <p>
    Bypass mode stops Orca from handling commands and lets the application receive them instead.
  </p>
  <section id="commands-bypass-mode">
    <title>Commands</title>
    <p>
      <em style="strong">Preferences location:</em>
      <gui>Commands</gui> category, <gui>Commands</gui> section, <gui>Bypass mode</gui> group.
    </p>
    <list>
      <item>
        <p>
          <gui>Toggle all Orca command keys</gui>: <keyseq>
            <key>Alt</key>
            <key>Backspace</key>
          </keyseq>
        </p>
        <p>
          Turns bypass mode on or off. Switching to another application also ends bypass mode.
          While it is active, keys normally used as <key>Orca Modifier</key> keys are passed through
          to the application too.
        </p>
